.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-POLICY-DRAFT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-policy\-draft \- Draft advisory policy Turtle from an exemplar and an intent
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu policy draft\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-exemplar\fR] [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-label\fR] [\fB\-\-targets\fR] [\fB\-\-claim\fR] [\fB\-\-class\fR] [\fB\-\-point\fR] [\fB\-\-layer\fR] [\fB\-\-authority\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draft advisory policy Turtle from an exemplar and an intent
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-exemplar\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Source exemplar for a policy draft
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Name of the generated object
.TP
\fB\-\-label\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Human\-readable label for the draft
.TP
\fB\-\-targets\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Target class IRI for the policy
.TP
\fB\-\-claim\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
ASK query expressing the proposed policy claim
.TP
\fB\-\-class\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Policy classification: soft or hard
.TP
\fB\-\-point\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Policy verification point
.TP
\fB\-\-layer\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Policy enforcement layer
.TP
\fB\-\-authority\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Authority identifier for the operation
.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Output file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
